c.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/423640/extras/ef60b5ee87b7c417c4a43df866abacad.avif?t=1718325941\" /></div><br>Earn tips from your work at the Cafe, and spend it on dates and items in the shops! Date multiple women from the game world! Buy them gifts and other items to unlock secret events.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Deal with the Occult</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/423640/extras/93f0bb089b51fd0668becfa504ade85b.avif?t=1718325941\" /></div><br>Even the supernatural is not out of the picture! That\u2019s what Michael finds out when a Succubus named Envy decides to have some fun with him!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Extra Adult Content!</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/423640/extras/c61baeed7e4522d405c18876bf62047b.poster.avif?t=1718325941\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/423640/extras/c61baeed7e4522d405c18876bf62047b.webm?t=1718325941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/423640/extras/c61baeed7e4522d405c18876bf62047b.mp4?t=1718325941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Interested in some extra spiciness? Check out our DLC for even more high quality adult content!",
